## Known issues / notes
- Scene green-mask density is lower than earlier runs (~0.02 vs ~0.12),
  making detection flicker near the threshold; being addressed via light
  intensity and a lower `min_mask_frac`. Does not affect the logged
  baseline above.
- Perception and control are tuned for straight rows (1.8 m spacing).
  Curved rows and uneven spacing untested — planned as edge-case scenarios.

